{
  "about": "Who may receive which campaign email (PRD-shopify-customer-migration slice 08). One table, two readers: lib/customer-migration/__tests__/campaign.test.ts runs campaignBlocker over it, and assert-08-campaign-sends.sql runs campaign_send_blocker() over it in Postgres. `expected` is the blocker, or null when the Customer may receive the template. `days_ago` dates a send relative to `now`. Synthetic: invented Customers, no real data.",
  "now": "2026-10-21T04:00:00Z",
  "cases": [
    { "name": "announcement: subscribed, unclaimed, never emailed", "template": "migration_announcement", "customer": { "marketing_email": "subscribed" }, "expected": null },
